            "content": "<p>These ear clips are intended to:<\/p><ul><li>Facilitate the delivery of cranial electrotherapy stimulation (CES) by connecting to the earlobes.<br\/><\/li><li>Serve as replacement accessories for the MyoCalme device.<\/li><\/ul>",
