            "title": "Benefits",
            "content": "<ul><li><strong>Effective Therapy<\/strong>: Ensures consistent and effective delivery of CES therapy.<br\/><\/li><li><strong>Convenience<\/strong>: Easy to attach and detach, facilitating hassle-free use.<br\/><\/li><li><strong>Replacement<\/strong>: Ideal as a spare or replacement to maintain uninterrupted therapy sessions.<br\/><\/li><\/ul>",
